'''Imprisoned Dvergr''' are neutral [[Deep North]] creatures found in [[Mörkhalla]].

Like other [[Dvergr Rogue|Dvergr]], they don't attack players on their own. When a player damages one, it and all other neutral creatures within 20 meters, including other Dvergr, become hostile. They are enemies of the [[Factions|Deep North faction]], which includes [[Krigen]] and [[Hexen]], and the two sides fight each other.

