==Attacks and abilities==
Imprisoned Dvergr have similar attack patterns as regular [[Dvergr Rogue]] and [[Ashlands Dvergr]] but their health and damage are superior.

* '''Shoot''': a projectile from their [[Arbalest]] dealing 250 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage. The bolt travels at 40 meters per second. This attack can be used every six seconds when within 1–15 meters of a target.
* '''Melee''': 140 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] damage in a 2.5-meter, 90-degree arc. This attack can be used every four seconds when within 0.5–2.5 meters of a target.

